  "groundingSupports": [
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 60,
        "endIndex": 219,
        "text": "#### [0] iPhone Duo (apple.com)\n* **What is confirmed:** Apple officially unveiled the \"iPhone Duo\" on September 9, 2026, marking its first foldable smartphone"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 221,
        "endIndex": 354,
        "text": "It features a 7.6-inch inner display, 5.4-inch outer display, the A20 Pro chip, a dual-battery architecture, and Siri AI capabilities"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 356,
        "endIndex": 380,
        "text": "Pricing starts at $1,999"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 382,
        "endIndex": 480,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Pre-orders begin October 16, 2026, with retail availability on October 23"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 589,
        "endIndex": 692,
        "text": "#### [1] AirPods 5 (apple.com)\n* **What is confirmed:** Apple introduced AirPods 5 on September 9, 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 694,
        "endIndex": 857,
        "text": "The new model features open-ear Active Noise Cancellation (ANC), a redesigned multiport acoustic architecture, Live Translation, and hands-free Siri AI integration"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 859,
        "endIndex": 926,
        "text": "Base model is priced at $129, or $149 with a wireless charging case"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 928,
        "endIndex": 1012,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Retail store availability begins Friday, September 18, 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1130,
        "endIndex": 1551,
        "text": "#### [4] & [13] Paul Christiano Joins OpenAI Foundation Board & Safety Committee (Techmeme / TechCrunch / X)\n* **What is confirmed:** OpenAI announced on September 9, 2026, that AI alignment researcher Paul Christiano (Senior Tech Advisor at the US Center for AI Standards and Innovation / NIST, founder of Alignment Research Center) has joined the non-profit OpenAI Foundation Board and its Safety and Security Committee"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1553,
        "endIndex": 1622,
        "text": "He also serves as a non-voting observer on the OpenAI Group PBC board"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1624,
        "endIndex": 1797,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Upon joining, Christiano publicly stated that the AI industry is currently not on track to reduce acute loss-of-control risks to an acceptable level"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1799,
        "endIndex": 1931,
        "text": "Due to his government role at CAISI, he will recuse himself from all OpenAI-related matters and model evaluations conducted by CAISI"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        9,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2045,
        "endIndex": 2311,
        "text": "#### [5] Alibaba Set to Lead $300M Round in UniPat AI (Techmeme / Bloomberg)\n* **What is confirmed:** Bloomberg reported on September 10, 2026, that Alibaba Group is in final negotiations to lead a $300 million funding round for UniPat AI at a $2.5 billion valuation"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2313,
        "endIndex": 2452,
        "text": "UniPat AI focuses on AI model benchmarking, synthetic data generation, and testing; founder Li Kuan formerly worked at Alibaba's Tongyi Lab"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2454,
        "endIndex": 2586,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Story relies on anonymous sources familiar with the matter; deal terms are still subject to final agreement"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2702,
        "endIndex": 3080,
        "text": "#### [7] Amazon Names Mandiant Founder Kevin Mandia to Board of Directors (Techmeme / CNBC / Amazon SEC Filing)\n* **What is confirmed:** Amazon announced and filed an 8-K disclosing that cybersecurity veteran Kevin Mandia (founder of Mandiant, current CEO of Armadin) was elected to its Board of Directors on September 8, 2026, and appointed to its Audit and Security Committees"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        12,
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3082,
        "endIndex": 3237,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Disclosures noted standard equity grants (4,086 RSUs) and a minor governance footnote regarding a family member employed at Amazon"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3366,
        "endIndex": 3679,
        "text": "#### [8] Desert Ant Labs On-Device Models Launch (desertant.com / Hacker News)\n* **What is confirmed:** Startup Desert Ant Labs launched a suite of 18 specialized, lightweight on-device AI models covering vision, speech, and text tasks (e.g., Voz, Clear, Redact) with SDK support for Swift, Kotlin, and JavaScript"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3681,
        "endIndex": 3764,
        "text": "Models are hosted on Hugging Face and free for up to 100,000 monthly active devices"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3766,
        "endIndex": 3852,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Sourced from startup blog and developer community discussions"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3854,
        "endIndex": 3916,
        "text": "Commercial licensing terms apply beyond the 100k MAU threshold"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4034,
        "endIndex": 4351,
        "text": "#### [9] IEEE Spectrum on Autonomous Vehicle Safety Data (spectrum.ieee.org / Hacker News)\n* **What is confirmed:** IEEE Spectrum published an analysis summarizing safety studies and mileage data (such as Waymo's real-world driving data) suggesting autonomous vehicles have lower injury crash rates than human drivers"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4353,
        "endIndex": 4503,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** This is an analytical summary feature article rather than a breaking regulatory event or new primary scientific trial release"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4610,
        "endIndex": 4763,
        "text": "#### [10] iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max (apple.com)\n* **What is confirmed:** Apple introduced the iPhone 18 Pro and 18 Pro Max on September 9, 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4765,
        "endIndex": 4949,
        "text": "Key hardware upgrades include a vapor-cooled A20 Pro chip, a 48MP Fusion camera with variable aperture, enhanced low-light performance, longer battery life, and deeper Siri AI features"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        23,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4951,
        "endIndex": 5073,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Pre-orders begin Saturday, September 12, with in-store availability starting Friday, September 18"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5213,
        "endIndex": 5377,
        "text": "space / Hacker News)\n* **What is confirmed:** A personal blog post details how the author circumvented Google Ads moderation mechanics to run malicious ad campaigns"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5379,
        "endIndex": 5549,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Discovered via Hacker News; represents a single-author self-published blog post without independent security firm verification or Google response"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5673,
        "endIndex": 5949,
        "text": "#### [12] New Mexico Cambridge Analytica Trial Starts Against Meta (Techmeme / AP)\n* **What is confirmed:** Opening statements began on September 9, 2026, in Santa Fe state court in New Mexico’s lawsuit against Meta over data privacy and the 2016 Cambridge Analytica scandal"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        25,
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5951,
        "endIndex": 6125,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** New Mexico is the only US state taking this specific privacy data breach issue to trial after 48 other states signed a broader multi-state settlement"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6127,
        "endIndex": 6192,
        "text": "Mark Zuckerberg’s video deposition is expected during the trial"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6290,
        "endIndex": 6630,
        "text": "#### [16] Australia Rejects US Criticism of Social Media Algorithm Rules (Reuters)\n* **What is confirmed:** The Australian government stated on September 9, 2026, that its alliance with the US remains intact despite White House criticism of proposed Australian legislation allowing users to opt out of social media recommendation algorithms"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6632,
        "endIndex": 6862,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** White House officials characterized fines on US tech firms as potential \"extortion,\" though Australian Communications Minister Anika Wells noted no official formal contact had been received from Washington"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6980,
        "endIndex": 7208,
        "text": "#### [17] Meta Launches Muse Personal AI Agent (Reuters)\n* **What is confirmed:** Meta released \"Muse\" (internally codenamed Hatch) on September 8, 2026, an autonomous AI agent available in the US on WhatsApp and a dedicated app"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7210,
        "endIndex": 7371,
        "text": "Running in individual virtual machines, it can carry out background tasks across external apps (sending emails, travel booking, payments via Stripe virtual card)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7373,
        "endIndex": 7436,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Initially limited to US users aged 18+"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7373,
        "endIndex": 7530,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Initially limited to US users aged 18+; Reuters noted internal employee concerns regarding agent handling of sensitive personal data"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7532,
        "endIndex": 7570,
        "text": "Paid tiers exist at $20/mo and $100/mo"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 7667,
        "endIndex": 7928,
        "text": "#### [19] Qualcomm & Amazon Custom AI Chip Partnership (Reuters)\n* **What is confirmed:** Qualcomm announced a multi-generational agreement with Amazon Web Services (AWS) on September 8, 2026, to develop custom AI inference chips and 1.6 Tbps optical networking"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
